# KANADE — Japanese Voice Lines

A private AudioFolder dataset of Japanese voice audio and matched text extracted from KANADE. The original game and performances belong to their rights holders.

## Dataset Summary

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Game | KANADE |
| Audio language | Japanese (ja) only |
| Accepted utterances | {{ACCEPTED_COUNT}} |
| Verified audio duration | {{DURATION_SECONDS}} seconds |
| Speakers with accepted audio | {{SPEAKER_COUNT}} |
| Physical source OGGs | {{PHYSICAL_COUNT}} |
| Rejected records | {{REJECTED_COUNT}} |
| Orphan OGGs | {{ORPHAN_COUNT}} |
| Distribution format | AudioFolder metadata plus mono PCM WAV |

## Directory Layout

